                                "sense_id": "f4d20130-7f05-3432-bfe4-e673e56dee1e",
                                "text": "I had given me the name of my grandfather, my mother's father, who, together with a sister of Sir Thomas Evelyn of Long-Ditton, and Mr. Comber, a near relation of my mother, were my susceptors."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44c68ec7-b477-4ee7-b40f-d818d9bd45d9",
                                "sense_id": "f4d20130-7f05-3432-bfe4-e673e56dee1e",
                                "text": "such susceptors were thought to put an obligation on the credits"
                            }
